{{Quote|That is the peak of Umate, the highest mountain on Coruscant. They say it's the only place on the entire surface where you can see the planet itself.|[[Elia Kane]], introducing the Umate to [[Penn Pershing]]|<ref name="Chapter 19" />}}
'''Umate''' was the highest [[mountain]] in the [[Manarai range]] on [[Coruscant]], and by the [[Republic Era]], the only uncovered mountain on the [[ecumenopolis]]. The mountain's body, below the plaza, was incorporated into the [[city]]-[[planet]]'s fabric, becoming riddled with tunnels. Umate's peak, the centerpiece of [[Monument Plaza]], became a popular visiting spot for tourists, and during her term of office, [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Lina Soh]] liked to visit the spot as well.<ref name="Light of the Jedi" />

Touching the Umate was forbidden during the [[New Republic Era|time]] of the [[New Republic]] and attempting to do so would result in a [[droid]] warning against physical contact with the mountain.<ref name="Chapter 19" />

